{"v":4,"catch":"與邪惡鬥爭，戰勝壞人，拯救王國!","desc":"巫師加里對王國的影響力越來越大，混亂正在席卷整個王國。\n\n你是唯一能結束這一切的人。拿起你的裝備，開始一場拯救世界的冒險吧!\n\n作為祖里西亞王國的救世主，你將與巫師，勇士和王國的守護者對戰。在你拯救王國的路上，你會遇到許多危險的敵人\n\n如果不喜歡故事模式，你也可以在生存模式中挑戰自己並提高技能，或者在PvP玩家對玩家模式中挑戰你的朋友並互相對戰!","publisher":"Flying Spaghetti","release":"2022-08-18","genres":["動作","格鬥","冒險","派對"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["英文","德文","俄文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6824a98be6622f978df5b2bfb200fdec041497cb9b8ceab24139ed8bcccf1165.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e56397f1c11ba819caed8b3a96563c2791bf22a3a80e42c1438ffc703c4aca0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8035ed3a25d753637be0a6d816afbf709718e2b509f1e84c016dd30413dddd1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb57efab4020eae11bc586d65e7163a55afa7de8b9c37bc567862ce43a1a8737.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e22bb0169c43ad8ceac57f211a71958683abc734a3c18f8017b0aa631b2135d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea87eab3be72ff667669ab89463860a15826d9a0e3ba9f88b94de935b2dbd973.jpg"],"titleId":"01009b4013c00000","dlc":[]}